# Public publish needs an ask

"Give me the file" or "give me the link" is not permission to host on an **unauthenticated** URL. Until the owner explicitly says to make it public, deliver the file in chat or put it behind login.

Private git push is not public publishing. An unguessable address is not access control.

If it went up and the owner said no: take it down the same turn and prove the address no longer serves.

Gate: `assertPublicPublishAsked` in `src/lib/public-publish.ts`.

